Z||000000||86SE||06-29-2000||02:00 AM||||Do I jus drive the car into a Pontiac dealership and tell them "I just bought the car and was informed the recall work has not been done on it"?  And will they do it? Or supposed to do it?<P>Anyways, even if they start doing it, how long will it take them to do it.  I will be driving the car to Omaha NE in 2 weeks to get it repainted.  Painting will take at least a week.  Do you think they could have the work done in lets say, 3 days?||||reg||11
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||06-29-2000||05:06 AM||||I dont think they will do it for free. Im sure the time limit has run out on the recall.||||reg||9
